{"text": "It is a truth universally acknowledged, that a single man in possession of a good fortune must be in want of a wife.", "paragraph": 0, "words": ["It", "is", "a", "truth", "universally", "acknowledged", ",", "that", "a", "single", "man", "in", "possession", "of", "a", "good", "fortune", "must", "be", "in", "want", "of", "a", "wife", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "DET", "NOUN", "ADV", "VERB", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "AUX", "AUX", "ADP", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBZ", "DT", "NN", "RB", "VBN", ",", "IN", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "IN", "NN", "IN", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "MD", "VB", "IN", "NN", "IN", "DT", "NN", "."], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 0, 6, 4, 21, 21, 11, 11, 21, 13, 11, 17, 17, 17, 13, 21, 21, 21, 4, 24, 24, 21, 4], "rels": ["expl", "cop", "det", "root", "advmod", "acl", "punct", "mark", "det", "amod", "nsubj", "case", "nmod", "case", "det", "amod", "nmod", "aux", "cop", "case", "acl:relcl", "case", "det", "nmod", "punct"]},
{"text": "However little known the feelings or views of such a man may be on his first entering a neighbourhood, this truth is so well fixed in the minds of the surrounding families, that he is considered as the rightful property of some one or other of their daughters.", "paragraph": 1, "words": ["However", "little", "known", "the", "feelings", "or", "views", "of", "such", "a", "man", "may", "be", "on", "his", "first", "entering", "a", "neighbourhood", ",", "this", "truth", "is", "so", "well", "fixed", "in", "the", "minds", "of", "the", "surrounding", "families", ",", "that", "he", "is", "considered", "as", "the", "rightful", "property", "of", "some", "one", "or", "other", "of", "their", "daughters", "."], "upos": ["ADV", "ADJ", "VERB", "DET", "NOUN", "CCONJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "DET", "NOUN", "AUX", "AUX", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "VERB", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "DET", "NOUN", "AUX", "ADV", "ADV", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "VERB", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "NUM", "CCONJ", "ADJ", "ADP", "PRON", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["RB", "JJ", "VBN", "DT", "NNS", "CC", "NNS", "IN", "PDT", "DT", "NN", "MD", "VB", "IN", "PRP$", "JJ", "VBG", "DT", "NN", ",", "DT", "NN", "VBZ", "RB", "RB", "VBN", "IN", "DT", "NNS", "IN", "DT", "VBG", "NNS", ",", "IN", "PRP", "VBZ", "VBN", "IN", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "IN", "DT", "CD", "CC", "JJ", "IN", "PRP$", "NNS", "."], "heads": [16, 3, 16, 5, 3, 7, 5, 11, 11, 11, 5, 16, 16, 16, 16, 0, 16, 19, 17, 26, 22, 26, 26, 25, 26, 16, 29, 29, 26, 33, 33, 33, 29, 38, 38, 38, 38, 26, 42, 42, 42, 38, 45, 45, 42, 47, 45, 50, 50, 45, 16], "rels": ["advmod", "advmod", "csubj", "det", "obj", "cc", "conj", "case", "det:predet", "det", "nmod", "aux", "cop", "case", "nmod:poss", "root", "advcl", "det", "obj", "punct", "det", "nsubj:pass", "aux:pass", "advmod", "advmod", "parataxis", "case", "det", "obl", "case", "det", "amod", "nmod", "punct", "mark", "nsubj:pass", "aux:pass", "advcl",