{"text": "“But it is,” returned she; “for Mrs. Long has just been here, and she told me all about it.”", "paragraph": 4, "words": ["“", "But", "it", "is", ",", "”", "returned", "she", ";", "“", "for", "Mrs.", "Long", "has", "just", "been", "here", ",", "and", "she", "told", "me", "all", "about", "it", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "ADP", "PROPN", "PROPN", "AUX", "ADV", "AUX", "ADV", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "DET", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "CC", "PRP", "VBZ", ",", "''", "VBD", "PRP", ":", "``", "IN", "NNP", "NNP", "VBZ", "RB", "VBN", "RB", ",", "CC", "PRP", "VBD", "PRP", "DT", "IN", "PRP", ".", "''"], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 7, 4, 4, 0, 7, 17, 17, 13, 13, 17, 17, 17, 17, 7, 21, 21, 21, 17, 21, 21, 25, 21, 17, 17], "rels": ["punct", "cc", "nsubj", "ccomp", "punct", "punct", "root", "nsubj", "punct", "punct", "case", "nmod:desc", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "cop", "ccomp", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "conj", "iobj", "obj", "case", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
