{"text": "“How so? how can it affect them?”", "paragraph": 17, "words": ["“", "How", "so", "?", "how", "can", "it", "affect", "them", "?", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "ADV", "ADV", "PUNCT", "ADV", "AUX", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "WRB", "RB", ".", "WRB", "MD", "PRP", "VB", "PRP", ".", "''"], "heads": [8, 3, 8, 3, 8, 8, 8, 0, 8, 8, 8], "rels": ["punct", "advmod", "advmod", "punct", "advmod", "aux", "nsubj", "root", "obj", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“My dear Mr. Bennet,” replied his wife, “how can you be so tiresome?", "paragraph": 18, "words": ["“", "My", "dear", "Mr.", "Bennet", ",", "”", "replied", "his", "wife", ",", "“", "how", "can", "you", "be", "so", "tiresome", "?"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "ADJ", "PROPN", "PROPN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "ADV", "AUX", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP$", "JJ", "NNP", "NNP", ",", "''", "VBD", "PRP$", "NN", ",", "``", "WRB", "MD", "PRP", "VB", "RB", "JJ", "."], "heads": [5, 5, 5, 5, 8, 5, 5, 0, 10, 8, 18, 18, 18, 18, 18, 18, 18, 8, 8], "rels": ["punct", "nmod:poss", "amod", "nmod:desc", "ccomp", "punct", "punct", "root", "nmod:poss", "iobj", "punct", "punct", "advmod", "aux", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "ccomp", "punct"]},
