{"text": "You and the girls may go--or you may send them by themselves, which perhaps will be still better; for as you are as handsome as any of them, Mr. Bingley might like you the best of the party.”", "paragraph": 21, "words": ["You", "and", "the", "girls", "may", "go", "--", "or", "you", "may", "send", "them", "by", "themselves", ",", "which", "perhaps", "will", "be", "still", "better", ";", "for", "as", "you", "are", "as", "handsome", "as", "any", "of", "them", ",", "Mr.", "Bingley", "might", "like", "you", "the", "best", "of", "the", "party", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PRON", "CCONJ", "DET", "NOUN", "AUX", "VERB", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PRON", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PRON", "ADV", "AUX", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "ADP", "DET", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PROPN", "PROPN", "AUX", "VERB", "PRON", "DET", "ADJ", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "CC", "DT", "NNS", "MD", "VB", ",", "CC", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "PRP", "IN", "PRP", ",", "WDT", "RB", "MD", "VB", "RB", "JJR", ",", "IN", "IN", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "JJ", "IN", "DT", "IN", "PRP", ",", "NNP", "NNP", "MD", "VB", "PRP", "DT", "JJS", "IN", "DT", "NN", ".", "''"], "heads": [6, 4, 4, 1, 6, 0, 11, 11, 11, 11, 6, 11, 14, 11, 21, 21, 21, 21, 21, 21, 14, 37, 37, 28, 28, 28, 28, 37, 30, 28, 32, 30, 28, 35, 37, 37, 6, 37, 40, 37, 43, 43, 40, 6, 6], "rels": ["nsubj", "cc", "det", "conj", "aux", "root", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "aux", "conj", "obj", "case", "obl", "punct", "nsubj", "advmod", "aux", "cop", "advmod", "acl:relcl", "punct", "mark", "mark", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "advcl", "case", "obl", "case", "nmod", "punct", "nmod:desc", "nsubj", "aux", "conj", "iobj", "det", "obj", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“My dear, you flatter me.", "paragraph": 22, "words": ["“", "My", "dear", ",", "you", "flatter", "me", "."], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP$", "JJ", ",", "PRP", "VBP", "PRP", "."], "heads": [6, 3, 6, 3, 6, 0, 6, 6], "rels": ["punct", "nmod:poss", "discourse", "punct", "nsubj", "root", "obj", "punct"]},
{"text": "I certainly _have_ had my share of beauty, but I do not pretend to be anything extraordinary now.", "paragraph": 22, "words": ["I", "certainly", "_have_", "had", "my", "share", "of", "beauty", ",", "but", "I", "do", "not", "pretend", "to", "be", "anything", "extraordinary", "now", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "ADV", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "ADP", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "VERB", "PART", "AUX", "PRON", "ADJ", "ADV", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "RB", "PRP", "VBD", "PRP$", "NN", "IN", "NN", ",", "CC", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "VB", "TO", "VB", "NN", "JJ", "RB", "."], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 0, 6, 4, 8, 6, 14, 14, 14, 14, 14, 4, 17, 17, 14, 17, 17, 4], "rels": ["nsubj", "advmod", "advmod", "root", "nmod:poss", "obj", "case", "nmod", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "conj", "mark", "cop", "xcomp", "amod", "advmod", "punct"]},
{"text": "When a woman has five grown-up daughters, she ought to give over thinking of her own beauty.”", "paragraph": 22, "words": ["When", "a", "woman", "has", "five", "grown", "-", "up", "daughters", ",", "she", "ought", "to", "give", "over", "thinking", "of", "her", "own", "beauty", ".", "”"], "upos": ["ADV", "DET", "NOUN", "VERB", "NUM", "VERB", "PUNCT", "ADP", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "VERB", "ADP", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["WRB", "DT", "NN", "VBZ", "CD", "VBN", "HYPH", "RP", "NNS", ",", "PRP", "MD", "TO", "VB", "RP", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "JJ", "NN", ".", "''"], "heads": [4, 3, 4, 12, 9, 9, 8, 6, 4, 4, 12, 0, 14, 12, 14, 14, 20, 20, 20, 16, 12, 12], "rels": ["advmod", "det", "nsubj", "advcl", "nummod", "amod", "punct", "compound", "obj", "punct", "nsubj", "root", "mark", "xcomp", "compound:prt", "obj", "case", "nmod:poss", "amod", "nmod", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“In such cases, a woman has not often much beauty to think of.”", "paragraph": 23, "words": ["“", "In", "such", "cases", ",", "a", "woman", "has", "not", "often", "much", "beauty", "to", "think", "of", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "ADP", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "DET", "NOUN", "AUX", "PART", "ADV", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PART", "VERB", "ADP", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "IN", "JJ", "NNS", ",", "DT", "NN", "VBZ", "RB", "RB", "JJ", "NN", "TO", "VB", "IN", ".", "''"], "heads": [12, 4, 4, 8, 4, 7, 12, 0, 12, 11, 12, 8, 14, 12, 14, 12, 12], "rels": ["punct", "case", "amod", "obl", "punct", "det", "nsubj", "root", "advmod", "advmod", "amod", "obj", "mark", "acl", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“But, my dear, you must indeed go and see Mr. Bingley when he comes into the neighbourhood.”", "paragraph": 24, "words": ["“", "But", ",", "my", "dear", ",", "you", "must", "indeed", "go", "and", "see", "Mr.", "Bingley", "when", "he", "comes", "into", "the", "neighbourhood", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PUNCT", "PRON", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "VERB", "CCONJ", "VERB", "PROPN", "PROPN", "ADV", "PRON", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "CC", ",", "PRP$", "JJ", ",", "PRP", "MD", "RB", "VB", "CC", "VB", "NNP", "NNP", "WRB", "PRP", "VBZ", "IN", "DT", "NN", ".", "''"], "heads": [10, 10, 2, 5, 10, 5, 10, 10, 10, 0, 12, 10, 14, 12, 17, 17, 12, 20, 20, 17, 10, 10], "rels": ["punct", "cc", "punct", "nmod:poss", "discourse", "punct", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "root", "cc", "conj", "nmod:desc", "obj", "advmod", "nsubj", "advcl", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
