{"text": "Only think what an establishment it would be for one of them.", "paragraph": 26, "words": ["Only", "think", "what", "an", "establishment", "it", "would", "be", "for", "one", "of", "them", "."], "upos": ["ADV", "VERB", "DET", "DET", "NOUN", "PRON", "AUX", "AUX", "ADP", "NUM", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["RB", "VB", "WDT", "DT", "NN", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "IN", "CD", "IN", "PRP", "."], "heads": [2, 0, 5, 5, 2, 5, 5, 5, 10, 5, 12, 10, 2], "rels": ["advmod", "root", "det:predet", "det", "ccomp", "nsubj", "aux", "cop", "case", "obl", "case", "nmod", "punct"]},
{"text": "Sir William and Lady Lucas are determined to go, merely on that account; for in general, you know, they visit no new comers.", "paragraph": 26, "words": ["Sir", "William", "and", "Lady", "Lucas", "are", "determined", "to", "go", ",", "merely", "on", "that", "account", ";", "for", "in", "general", ",", "you", "know", ",", "they", "visit", "no", "new", "comers", "."], "upos": ["PROPN", "PROPN", "CCONJ", "PROPN", "PROPN", "AUX", "ADJ", "PART", "VERB", "PUNCT", "ADV", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "ADP", "ADP", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["NNP", "NNP", "CC", "NNP", "NNP", "VBP", "JJ", "TO", "VB", ",", "RB", "IN", "DT", "NN", ",", "IN", "IN", "JJ", ",", "PRP", "VBP", ",", "PRP", "VBP", "DT", "JJ", "NNS", "."], "heads": [2, 7, 5, 5, 2, 7, 0, 9, 7, 14, 14, 14, 14, 9, 16, 24, 18, 24, 18, 21, 24, 21, 24, 7, 27, 27, 24, 7], "rels": ["nmod:desc", "nsubj", "cc", "nmod:desc", "conj", "cop", "root", "mark", "xcomp", "punct", "advmod", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "mark", "case", "obl", "punct", "nsubj", "parataxis", "punct", "nsubj", "parataxis", "det", "amod", "obj", "punct"]},
{"text": "Indeed you must go, for it will be impossible for _us_ to visit him, if you do not.”", "paragraph": 26, "words": ["Indeed", "you", "must", "go", ",", "for", "it", "will", "be", "impossible", "for", "_us_", "to", "visit", "him", ",", "if", "you", "do", "not", ".", "”"], "upos": ["ADV", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "AUX", "ADJ", "SCONJ", "NOUN", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["RB", "PRP", "MD", "VB", ",", "IN", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "JJ", "IN", "NN", "TO", "VB", "PRP", ",", "IN", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", ".", "''"], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 0, 10, 10, 10, 10, 10, 4, 14, 14, 14, 10, 14, 19, 19, 19, 10, 19, 4, 4], "rels": ["advmod", "nsubj", "aux", "root", "punct", "mark", "expl", "aux", "cop", "advcl", "mark", "nsubj", "mark", "csubj", "obj", "punct", "mark", "nsubj", "advcl", "advmod", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“You are over scrupulous, surely.", "paragraph": 27, "words": ["“", "You", "are", "over", "scrupulous", ",", "surely", "."], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "ADV", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "JJ", ",", "RB", "."], "heads": [5, 5, 5, 5, 0, 7, 5, 5], "rels": ["punct", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "root", "punct", "advmod", "punct"]},
{"text": "I dare say Mr. Bingley will be very glad to see you; and I will send a few lines by you to assure him of my hearty consent to his marrying whichever he chooses of the girls--though I must throw in a good word for my little Lizzy.”", "paragraph": 27, "words": ["I", "dare", "say", "Mr.", "Bingley", "will", "be", "very", "glad", "to", "see", "you", ";", "and", "I", "will", "send", "a", "few", "lines", "by", "you", "to", "assure", "him", "of", "my", "hearty", "consent", "to", "his", "marrying", "whichever", "he", "chooses", "of", "the", "girls", "--", "though", "I", "must", "throw", "in", "a", "good", "word", "for", "my", "little", "Lizzy", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PROPN", "PROPN", "AUX", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "NOUN", "PRON", "PRON", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "PROPN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "VB", "NNP", "NNP", "MD", "VB", "RB", "JJ", "TO", "VB", "PRP", ",", "CC", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "DT", "JJ", "NNS", "IN", "PRP", "TO", "VB", "PRP", "IN", "PRP$", "JJ", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "NN", "WP", "PRP", "VBZ", "IN", "DT", "NNS", ",", "IN", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "IN", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "JJ", "NNP", ".", "''"], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 5, 9, 9, 9, 9, 3, 11, 9, 11, 17, 17, 17, 17, 3, 20, 20, 17, 22, 17, 24, 17, 24, 29, 29, 29, 24, 32, 32, 29, 35, 35, 32, 38, 38, 35, 43, 43, 43, 43, 17, 43, 47, 47, 43, 51, 51, 51, 43, 3, 3], "rels": ["nsubj", "aux", "root", "nmod:desc", "nsubj", "aux", "cop", "advmod", "ccomp", "mark", "xcomp", "obj", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "aux", "conj", "det", "amod", "obj", "case", "obl", "mark", "advcl", "iobj", "case", "nmod:poss", "amod", "obl", "case", "nmod:poss", "nmod", "obj", "nsubj", "acl:relcl", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "mark", "nsubj", "aux", "advcl", "compound:prt", "det", "amod", "obj", "case", "nmod:poss", "amod", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“I desire you will do no such thing.", "paragraph": 28, "words": ["“", "I", "desire", "you", "will", "do", "no", "such", "thing", "."], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP", "VBP", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "."], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 6, 6, 3, 9, 9, 6, 3], "rels": ["punct", "nsubj", "root", "nsubj", "aux", "ccomp", "det", "amod", "obj", "punct"]},
{"text": "Lizzy is not a bit better than the others: and I am sure she is not half so handsome as Jane, nor half so good-humoured as Lydia.", "paragraph": 28, "words": ["Lizzy", "is", "not", "a", "bit", "better", "than", "the", "others", ":", "and", "I", "am", "sure", "she", "is", "not", "half", "so", "handsome", "as", "Jane", ",", "nor", "half", "so", "good", "-", "humoured", "as", "Lydia", "."], "upos": ["PROPN", "AUX", "PART", "DET", "NOUN", "ADJ", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "ADJ", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "NOUN", "ADV", "ADJ", "ADP", "PROPN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "NOUN", "ADV", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "ADJ", "ADP", "PROPN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["NNP", "VBZ", "RB", "DT", "NN", "JJR", "IN", "DT", "NNS", ":", "CC", "PRP", "VBP", "JJ", "PRP", "VBZ", "RB", "NN", "RB", "JJ", "IN", "NNP", ",", "CC", "NN", "RB", "JJ", "HYPH", "JJ", "IN", "NNP", "."], "heads": [6, 6, 6, 5, 6, 0, 9, 9, 6, 14, 14, 14, 14, 6, 20, 20, 20, 20, 20, 14, 22, 20, 29, 29, 29, 29, 29, 27, 20, 31, 29, 6], "rels": ["nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "det", "obl:unmarked", "root", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "cop", "conj", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "advmod", "advmod", "ccomp", "case", "obl", "punct", "cc", "advmod", "advmod", "compound", "punct", "conj", "case", "obl", "punct"]},
{"text": "But you are always giving _her_ the preference.”", "paragraph": 28, "words": ["But", "you", "are", "always", "giving", "_her_", "the", "preference", ".", "”"], "upos": ["CCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "VERB", "INTJ", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["CC", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "VBG", "UH", "DT", "NN", ".", "''"], "heads": [5, 5, 5, 5, 0, 5, 8, 5, 5, 5], "rels": ["cc", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "root", "iobj", "det", "obj", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“They have none of them much to recommend them,” replied he: “they are all silly and ignorant like other girls; but Lizzy has something more of quickness than her sisters.”", "paragraph": 29, "words": ["“", "They", "have", "none", "of", "them", "much", "to", "recommend", "them", ",", "”", "replied", "he", ":", "“", "they", "are", "all", "silly", "and", "ignorant", "like", "other", "girls", ";", "but", "Lizzy", "has", "something", "more", "of", "quickness", "than", "her", "sisters", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "CCONJ", "ADJ", "ADP", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PROPN", "VERB", "PRON", "ADJ", "ADP", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP", "VBP", "NN", "IN", "PRP", "JJ", "TO", "VB", "PRP", ",", "''", "VBD", "PRP", ":", "``", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "JJ", "CC", "JJ", "IN", "JJ", "NNS", ",", "CC", "NNP", "VBZ", "NN", "JJR", "IN", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "NNS", ".", "''"], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 3, 6, 4, 4, 9, 3, 9, 3, 3, 3, 13, 20, 20, 20, 20, 20, 13, 22, 20, 25, 25, 20, 29, 29, 29, 20, 29, 30, 33, 31, 36, 36, 31, 20, 20], "rels": ["punct", "nsubj", "root", "obj", "case", "nmod", "amod", "mark", "advcl", "obj", "punct", "punct", "parataxis", "nsubj", "punct", "punct", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "ccomp", "cc", "conj", "case", "amod", "obl", "punct", "cc", "nsubj", "conj", "obj", "amod", "case", "obl", "case", "nmod:poss", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“Mr. Bennet, how can you abuse your own children in such a way?", "paragraph": 30, "words": ["“", "Mr.", "Bennet", ",", "how", "can", "you", "abuse", "your", "own", "children", "in", "such", "a", "way", "?"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PROPN", "PROPN", "PUNCT", "ADV", "AUX", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "DET", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "NNP", "NNP", ",", "WRB", "MD", "PRP", "VB", "PRP$", "JJ", "NNS", "IN", "PDT", "DT", "NN", "."], "heads": [8, 3, 8, 3, 8, 8, 8, 0, 11, 11, 8, 15, 15, 15, 8, 8], "rels": ["punct", "nmod:desc", "vocative", "punct", "advmod", "aux", "nsubj", "root", "nmod:poss", "amod", "obj", "case", "det:predet", "det", "obl", "punct"]},
{"text": "You take delight in vexing me.", "paragraph": 30, "words": ["You", "take", "delight", "in", "vexing", "me", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "VERB", "NOUN", "SCONJ", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "NN", "IN", "VBG", "PRP", "."], "heads": [2, 0, 2, 5, 2, 5, 2], "rels": ["nsubj", "root", "obj", "mark", "advcl", "obj", "punct"]},
{"text": "You have no compassion on my poor nerves.”", "paragraph": 30, "words": ["You", "have", "no", "compassion", "on", "my", "poor", "nerves", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PRON", "VERB", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "DT", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "JJ", "NNS", ".", "''"], "heads": [2, 0, 4, 2, 8, 8, 8, 4, 2, 2], "rels": ["nsubj", "root", "det", "obj", "case", "nmod:poss", "amod", "nmod", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“You mistake me, my dear.", "paragraph": 31, "words": ["“", "You", "mistake", "me", ",", "my", "dear", "."], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PRON", "ADJ", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP", "VBP", "PRP", ",", "PRP$", "JJ", "."], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 3, 7, 7, 3, 3], "rels": ["punct", "nsubj", "root", "obj", "punct", "nmod:poss", "discourse", "punct"]},
{"text": "I have a high respect for your nerves.", "paragraph": 31, "words": ["I", "have", "a", "high", "respect", "for", "your", "nerves", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "VERB", "DET", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "DT", "JJ", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "NNS", "."], "heads": [2, 0, 5, 5, 2, 8, 8, 5, 2], "rels": ["nsubj", "root", "det", "amod", "obj", "case", "nmod:poss", "nmod", "punct"]},
{"text": "They are my old friends.", "paragraph": 31, "words": ["They", "are", "my", "old", "friends", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "PRON", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "PRP$", "JJ", "NNS", "."], "heads": [5, 5, 5, 5, 0, 5], "rels": ["nsubj", "cop", "nmod:poss", "amod", "root", "punct"]},
{"text": "I have heard you mention them with consideration these twenty years at least.”", "paragraph": 31, "words": ["I", "have", "heard", "you", "mention", "them", "with", "consideration", "these", "twenty", "years", "at", "least", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "ADP", "NOUN", "DET", "NUM", "NOUN", "ADP", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBP", "VBN", "PRP", "VB", "PRP", "IN", "NN", "DT", "CD", "NNS", "IN", "JJS", ".", "''"], "heads": [3, 3, 0, 5, 3, 5, 8, 5, 11, 11, 8, 13, 11, 3, 3], "rels": ["nsubj", "aux", "root", "nsubj", "xcomp", "obj", "case", "obl", "det", "nummod", "nmod:unmarked", "case", "nmod", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“Ah, you do not know what I suffer.”", "paragraph": 32, "words": ["“", "Ah", ",", "you", "do", "not", "know", "what", "I", "suffer", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "INTJ", "PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "PRON", "VERB", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "UH", ",", "PRP", "VBP", "RB", "VB", "WP", "PRP", "VBP", ".", "''"], "heads": [7, 7, 2, 7, 7, 7, 0, 7, 10, 8, 7, 7], "rels": ["punct", "discourse", "punct", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "root", "obj", "nsubj", "acl:relcl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“But I hope you will get over it, and live to see many young men of four thousand a year come into the neighbourhood.”", "paragraph": 33, "words": ["“", "But", "I", "hope", "you", "will", "get", "over", "it", ",", "and", "live", "to", "see", "many", "young", "men", "of", "four", "thousand", "a", "year", "come", "into", "the", "neighbourhood", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "VERB", "PART", "VERB", "ADJ", "ADJ", "NOUN", "ADP", "NUM", "NUM", "DET", "NOUN", "VERB", "ADP", "DET", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "CC", "PRP", "VBP", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "IN", "PRP", ",", "CC", "VB", "TO", "VB", "JJ", "JJ", "NNS", "IN", "CD", "CD", "DT", "NN", "VB", "IN", "DT", "NN", ".", "''"], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 0, 7, 7, 4, 9, 7, 12, 12, 7, 14, 12, 17, 17, 23, 20, 20, 17, 22, 20, 14, 26, 26, 23, 4, 4], "rels": ["punct", "cc", "nsubj", "root", "nsubj", "aux", "ccomp", "case", "obl", "punct", "cc", "conj", "mark", "advcl", "amod", "amod", "nsubj", "case", "nummod", "nmod", "det", "nmod:unmarked", "xcomp", "case", "det", "obl", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“It will be no use to us, if twenty such should come, since you will not visit them.”", "paragraph": 34, "words": ["“", "It", "will", "be", "no", "use", "to", "us", ",", "if", "twenty", "such", "should", "come", ",", "since", "you", "will", "not", "visit", "them", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "AUX", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "NUM", "ADJ", "AUX", "VERB", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "PRON", "AUX", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "DT", "NN", "IN", "PRP", ",", "IN", "CD", "JJ", "MD", "VB", ",", "IN", "PRP", "MD", "RB", "VB", "PRP", ".", "''"], "heads": [6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 0, 8, 6, 14, 14, 12, 14, 14, 6, 20, 20, 20, 20, 20, 14, 20, 6, 6], "rels": ["punct", "nsubj", "aux", "cop", "det", "root", "case", "obl", "punct", "mark", "nummod", "nsubj", "aux", "advcl", "punct", "mark", "nsubj", "aux", "advmod", "advcl", "obj", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "“Depend upon it, my dear, that when there are twenty, I will visit them all.”", "paragraph": 35, "words": ["“", "Depend", "upon", "it", ",", "my", "dear", ",", "that", "when", "there", "are", "twenty", ",", "I", "will", "visit", "them", "all", ".", "”"], "upos": ["PUNCT", "VERB", "ADP", "PRON", "PUNCT", "PRON", "ADJ", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "ADV", "PRON", "VERB", "NUM", "PUNCT", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PRON", "DET", "PUNCT", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["``", "VB", "IN", "PRP", ",", "PRP$", "JJ", ",", "IN", "WRB", "EX", "VBP", "CD", ",", "PRP", "MD", "VB", "PRP", "DT", ".", "''"], "heads": [2, 0, 4, 2, 7, 7, 2, 17, 17, 12, 12, 17, 12, 12, 17, 17, 2, 17, 18, 2, 2], "rels": ["punct", "root", "case", "obl", "punct", "nmod:poss", "vocative", "punct", "mark", "advmod", "expl", "advcl", "nsubj", "punct", "nsubj", "aux", "parataxis", "obj", "nmod:unmarked", "punct", "punct"]},
{"text": "Mr. Bennet was so odd a mixture of quick parts, sarcastic humour, reserve, and caprice, that the experience of three-and-twenty years had been insufficient to make his wife understand his character.", "paragraph": 36, "words": ["Mr.", "Bennet", "was", "so", "odd", "a", "mixture", "of", "quick", "parts", ",", "sarcastic", "humour", ",", "reserve", ",", "and", "caprice", ",", "that", "the", "experience", "of", "three", "-", "and", "-", "twenty", "years", "had", "been", "insufficient", "to", "make", "his", "wife", "understand", "his", "character", "."], "upos": ["PROPN", "PROPN", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "SCONJ", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "NUM", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "PUNCT", "NUM", "NOUN", "AUX", "AUX", "ADJ", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["NNP", "NNP", "VBD", "RB", "JJ", "DT", "NN", "IN", "JJ", "NNS", ",", "JJ", "NN", ",", "NN", ",", "CC", "NN", ",", "IN", "DT", "NN", "IN", "CD", "HYPH", "CC", "HYPH", "CD", "NNS", "VBD", "VBN", "JJ", "TO", "VB", "PRP$", "NN", "VB", "PRP$", "NN", "."], "heads": [2, 5, 5, 5, 0, 7, 5, 10, 10, 7, 13, 13, 10, 15, 10, 18, 18, 10, 32, 32, 22, 32, 29, 29, 26, 28, 26, 24, 22, 32, 32, 7, 34, 32, 36, 34, 34, 39, 37, 5], "rels": ["nmod:desc", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "root", "det", "obj", "case", "amod", "nmod", "punct", "amod", "conj", "punct", "conj", "punct", "cc", "conj", "punct", "mark", "det", "nsubj", "case", "nummod", "punct", "cc", "punct", "conj", "nmod", "aux", "cop", "acl:relcl", "mark", "advcl", "nmod:poss", "obj", "xcomp", "nmod:poss", "obj", "punct"]},
{"text": "_Her_ mind was less difficult to develope.", "paragraph": 36, "words": ["_Her_", "mind", "was", "less", "difficult", "to", "develope", "."], "upos": ["NOUN", "NOUN", "AUX", "ADV", "ADJ", "PART", "VERB", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["NN", "NN", "VBD", "RBR", "JJ", "TO", "VB", "."], "heads": [2, 5, 5, 5, 0, 7, 5, 5], "rels": ["compound", "nsubj", "cop", "advmod", "root", "mark", "xcomp", "punct"]},
{"text": "She was a woman of mean understanding, little information, and uncertain temper.", "paragraph": 36, "words": ["She", "was", "a", "woman", "of", "mean", "understanding", ",", "little", "information", ",", "and", "uncertain", "temper", "."], "upos": ["PRON", "AUX", "DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT", "CCONJ", "ADJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["PRP", "VBD", "DT", "NN", "IN", "JJ", "NN", ",", "JJ", "NN", ",", "CC", "JJ", "NN", "."], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 0, 7, 7, 4, 10, 10, 7, 14, 14, 14, 7, 4], "rels": ["nsubj", "cop", "det", "root", "case", "amod", "nmod", "punct", "amod", "conj", "punct", "cc", "amod", "conj", "punct"]},
{"text": "When she was discontented, she fancied herself nervous.", "paragraph": 36, "words": ["When", "she", "was", "discontented", ",", "she", "fancied", "herself", "nervous", "."], "upos": ["ADV", "PRON", "AUX", "VERB", "PUNCT", "PRON", "VERB", "PRON", "ADJ", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["WRB", "PRP", "VBD", "VBN", ",", "PRP", "VBD", "PRP", "JJ", "."], "heads": [4, 4, 4, 7, 4, 7, 0, 7, 7, 7], "rels": ["advmod", "nsubj:pass", "aux:pass", "advcl", "punct", "nsubj", "root", "obj", "xcomp", "punct"]},
{"text": "The business of her life was to get her daughters married: its solace was visiting and news.", "paragraph": 36, "words": ["The", "business", "of", "her", "life", "was", "to", "get", "her", "daughters", "married", ":", "it", "s", "solace", "was", "visiting", "and", "news", "."], "upos": ["DET", "NOUN", "ADP", "PRON", "NOUN", "AUX", "PART", "VERB", "PRON", "NOUN", "VERB", "PUNCT", "PRON", "PART", "NOUN", "AUX", "VERB", "CCONJ", "NOUN", "PUNCT"], "xpos": ["DT", "NN", "IN", "PRP$", "NN", "VBD", "TO", "VB", "PRP$", "NNS", "VBN", ":", "PRP", "POS", "NN", "VBD", "VBG", "CC", "NN", "."], "heads": [2, 8, 5, 5, 2, 8, 8, 0, 10, 8, 8, 17, 15, 13, 17, 17, 8, 19, 17, 8], "rels": ["det", "nsubj:outer", "case", "nmod:poss", "nmod", "cop", "mark", "root", "nmod:poss", "obj", "xcomp", "punct", "nmod:poss", "case", "nsubj", "aux", "parataxis", "cc", "conj", "punct"]},
